     "nodeId": "p20-uniform-definition-text",
     "replacement": "A continuous random variable is **uniformly distributed** on $[a,b]$, where $a<b$, if its PDF is constant on $[a,b]$ and zero elsewhere:\n\n$$f(x)=\\begin{cases}\\dfrac{1}{b-a}&\\text{for }a\\le x\\le b,\\\\0&\\text{otherwise.}\\end{cases}$$",
